{"4980520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Great Picture", "steam_appid": 4980520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2006, six artists—Jerry Burchfield, Mark Chamberlain, Jacques Garnier, Rob Johnson, Douglas McCulloh, and Clayton Spada—transformed an abandoned jet hangar at a decommissioned military air base in Irvine, California into a pinhole camera and made the world's largest print photograph. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This immersive experience re-creates both the hangar and the image they produced, The Great Picture, on its 20th anniversary.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2006, six artists—Jerry Burchfield, Mark Chamberlain, Jacques Garnier, Rob Johnson, Douglas McCulloh, and Clayton Spada—transformed an abandoned jet hangar at a decommissioned military air base in Irvine, California into a pinhole camera and made the world's largest print photograph. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This immersive experience re-creates both the hangar and the image they produced, The Great Picture, on its 20th anniversary.</p>", "short_description": "Through First Person and VR, users can explore the world's largest print photograph, The Great Picture.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4980520/3c01c33955b5f4cf6d94d6092432a41b345781dd/header.jpg?t=1787700965", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4980520/1775bded55c0deca76109ee87729ed0a080508b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787700965", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4980520/1775bded55c0deca76109ee87729ed0a080508b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787700965", "website": "https://ucrarts.ucr.edu/exhibitions/the-great-picture/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64